{
  "name": "[EXAMPLE, NOT DEPLOYED] Anna events - verify HMAC, route to CRM and calendar (placeholders)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EXAMPLE - NOT DEPLOYED\n\nReceives signed Anna events (booking.created / booking.rescheduled / booking.cancelled / handoff.requested), verifies HMAC-SHA256 and the timestamp window (300 s) in the Code node, then calls CRM and calendar PLACEHOLDER URLs.\n\nBefore use: set env ANNA_EVENTS_SIGNING_SECRET, ANNA_CRM_URL, ANNA_CALENDAR_URL; attach credential httpHeaderAuth; enable Raw Body on the Webhook node. See README.md. Never executed in a live n8n instance.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Note (example)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -340
      ]
    },
